    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n101412" body-key=""><b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">συσσῑτ-έω</span></b> , <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>A.</b><i>mess with</i>, <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">τινι</span>
			<i><span class="en">
				Ar.
				<u>Eq.</u>
				1325
			</span></i> (anap.), <i><span class="en">
				Lys.
				13.79
			</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
				Thphr.
				<u>Char.</u>
				10.3
			</span></i>, etc.; 
