					Philostr.
					<u>Her.</u>
					2.3
				</span></i>
			: abs. in pl., <i>mess together</i>, 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">συσσιτοῦμεν . . ἐγώ τε καὶ Μελησίας</span>”
